            },
            "reviewBody": "I omitted the mayo. I browned 1lb of sausage and added to the mix, it was an extra HIT!!! Gone in 20 minutes. I will make more the next time I make it. I loved it!!!",
            "datePublished": "2025-02-10T13:30:22.654Z"
